A company garage can now invite someone straight in as a driver.
Fixes:
• Archived vehicles no longer get reminders
• A driver's service closes its one-time reminder
• An incident reported with no signal is sent later
• Drivers see a Cars tab, and only buttons they can use
• A problem noted after midnight is dated that day
• A backup waits for a signal instead of saving old copies
• Offline edits are no longer lost after a slow save
• Old reminders the phone set itself no longer arrive
